{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea was supposed to take you \u2014 but something else had other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a remote island, your ship broken and the shoreline silent. Above you, a forgotten castle looms like a wound in the sky. Something is wrong here. Something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awake...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cursed Grave is a first-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere, tension, and exploration. With no weapons and no clear escape, you must navigate the island and the decaying castle at its heart \u2014 all while something stalks you from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is small but open, a place lost to time and covered in secrets. From abandoned paths to sealed chambers, you'll piece together the history of this cursed place \u2014 and your unwanted role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. Every step counts. The line between reality and hallucination blurs the longer you stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a fighter. You must hide, run, or think your way through. Solve puzzles, unlock forgotten doors, and stay ahead of whatever hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island brought you here for a reason.</strong><br><strong>It may not let you leave.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013680?t=1759589654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013680?t=1759589654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013680/e7da5dbc7f25d76f90e78b2d0df2f719ae159542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759589654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c